<section class="cs-section" id="hook">
  <div class="cs-intro-copy">
    <h2>A gallery without a website just seems hard to find.</h2>
    <p class="cs-subtitle">The real problem only shows up after someone already found it.</p>
    <div class="cs-intro-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
